<description>&lt;p&gt;The Myanmar military has stepped up cross-border airstrikes, bombing a health centre in Thailand’s Tak province, striking homes and an IDP camp, and targeting Karen positions in Mae Hong Son, prompting a seven-day suspension of unofficial border trade. In Myanmar, the junta’s forces bombed Arakan State daily and killed a major and a captain in clashes in Sittwe, while the Thai military chief summoned the Myanmar attaché over border fighting. Refugees are filling labor gaps in Thailand as Cambodian workers return home, and the United States is linking its diplomatic engagement on Myanmar peace talks to access to the country’s rare-earth resources. The UCDP recorded 2,332 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirwFBVV95cUxQektPMXRENjNVbGZYbW9uOE5TdHFnWkxqTWh0bmJqLWtFUnBMQ2xSM2s2am5ra3NLdEhBMFFhYTRYd29ENUx6eDI3YjBURW1BcW5jZ0RBSkowbEplM0lwY251UzZuWEZmZng0RGVvbkYxV090RTJlaVZvUkx5LWR1aFdfYWFTbmN2T05LbmRHOGhmOW5Cci1fSW96UjMxNDFuLThmMVo4V00teDd0a2Zr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiuwFBVV95cUxPT0hFWHdXT3NFQzVVVTVhNzl5dkUtVnVjZUlGd202TG1ERkluOW1MWk12TU8wUU40MW1kV0FYc2NqQVBJM0lvWk05Y1FFQUM0YWMzN0tTbkRvMlBwbXBpeTA3dVhvWEl3X1B6QVRjSXlCcjRGYmpZMnhpa0ZzOW1SQ0tSRXRKUTJZZWM2alBrbmpnWDdETzd0ZHBER3poSUdCcmVhY3lTWWZickVjVEtRd0ZIRFFBRDh4Wnhr?oc=5&quot;&gt;Nikkei Asia&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxNd25lb1d3STE5REUxUURpLVpxcnM0UUswYVhZT3MwbENIb1l1WUtRMmt0ZHRmaVg1LXpmbVE1RExQMUNmbUtvanZqNEpTczNTWDFIYUk0bW56bkJzNlFBVkNjYTBUNmVUV1kzczJVTk5kVWY4MVF2aFliZFlxeldWYXNVb1VBMnNJbE5Z?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMitAFBVV95cUxQOTdrZUJJRDJuU1luMGJCT2VfbTBCS3RmSXBHcHJRTkNyRmJMazVVWGJlYmMxS0ZlQkxGcFZreXVUM